+# SAIRE-Linked Academy / ProofLoop v10
+
+Start with [the v10 setup and rules guide](docs/PROOFLOOP_V10_LEARNER_EXPERIENCE.md) and [verified results](docs/VALIDATION_V10.md). This guide supersedes older setup/UI claims below. The live home page requires Django; sample-only browser progress is at `/demo/`. GitHub/Google buttons require your own OAuth credentials.
+
+Existing v9 assignment records and grading are preserved. Lesson unlocking now requires Django progression records; local demo completion is not trusted.
+
+---
+
+## Preserved v9 reference README
+
 # SAIRE-Linked Academy — ProofLoop v9 (Gemini + Personalised Mentor)
 
 **New:** Switchable Django AI provider (`gemini` for testing; `openai` later), optional Learning Twin-aware hints with explicit per-question opt-in, server-only credentials, Django `.env` support, dedicated provider contract tests, and all v8 grading/curriculum features preserved.
