+   <section className="academy-card"><h2>Your iteration rules</h2><p>14 days from starting. Passing unlocks the next lesson. A missed deadline fails the original attempt. One supplementary attempt ends on day 21 and caps credited marks at 70% (or your server’s configured cap). Quiz competence uses the published pass count. Lessons without quizzes require instructor sign-off. Exhausted attempts need instructor support; automatic resets are unavailable.</p><p>Times use your device’s time zone. Django’s clock decides acceptance. Projects unlock after all lessons up to that module are passed.</p></section>
