ver architecture","FastAPI, Django, authentication and authorization","SQL, PostgreSQL, indexes, joins and transactions","ORMs, migrations, caching, queues and background jobs","Docker, Linux, cloud services, CI/CD and deployment","Logging, performance, API security and scalable system design"],"project":"Production-Style SAIRE-Linked Business API"},{"id":5,"name":"Mathematics & Data Science","duration":6,"category":"intelligence","icon":"sigma","desc":"Understand the mathematical ideas behind learning from data.","topics":["Algebra, functions, logarithms and graph interpretation","Vectors, matrices, dot products and linear algebra","Probability, conditional probability and distributions","Statistics, sampling, hypothesis testing and uncertainty","Derivatives, gradients and optimisation intuition","NumPy, Pandas, Matplotlib and exploratory data analysis"],"project":"Business Sales Analysis & Forecasting Preparation"},{"id":6,"name":"Machine Learning","duration":6,"category":"intelligence","icon":"chart","desc":"Train, validate, and assess predictive models with confidence.","topics":["Supervised vs unsupervised learning","Regression, classification and clustering","Decision trees, random forests and boosting","Feature engineering, scaling and missing-data treatment","Training, validation, cross-validation and leakage","Metrics, overfitting, bias-variance and model interpretation"],"project":"Customer Churn Prediction API"},{"id":7,"name":"Deep Learning & NLP","duration":6,"category":"intelligence","icon":"network","desc":"Learn how neural networks and transformers represent information.","topics":["Neurons, layers and neural networks","Backpropagation and gradient descent","PyTorch tensors, autograd and training loops","Embeddings, sequence models and attention","Transformer architectures, tokenisation and pretraining","Transfer learning, fine-tuning and model evaluation"],"project":"Customer Message Intent Classifier"},{"id":8,"name":"Generative AI & LLM Applications","duration":5,"category":"intelligence","icon":"spark","desc":"Build grounded language-model apps, not just prompt demos.","topics":["Language model capabilities, limitations and model selection","Prompts, messages, context windows and structured outputs","LLM APIs, streaming, retries and rate limits","Context engineering and conversation state","Embeddings, semantic search and vector databases","RAG ingestion, chunking, retrieval, reranking and citations"],"project":"SAIRE-Linked Knowledge Assistant"},{"id":9,"name":"AI Agent Engineering","duration":8,"category":"agents","icon":"bot","desc":"Design agents that call tools, maintain state, and request approval.","topics":["Workflows versus agents; decision loops and tool use","Function calling, tool schemas and validation","Agent state, memory, checkpoints and recovery","LangGraph, routing, branching and orchestrated workflows","Model Context Protocol (MCP) and external integrations","Planning, delegation, multi-agent systems and human approval"],"project":"AI Business Operations Agent"},{"id":10,"name":"Production AI, Security & LLMOps","duration":6,"category":"agents","icon":"shield","desc":"Evaluate, safeguard, monitor, and maintain AI systems at scale.","topics":["Evaluation datasets, model and tool-use testing","Tracing, observability, reliability and failure analysis","Prompt injection, untrusted content and permission boundaries","PII protection, secrets management and data governance","Latency, token usage, caching, cost control and scaling","Human oversight, audit logs, deployment and rollback"],"project":"Secure, Evaluated AI Customer Support System"},{"id":11,"name":"Advanced AI Specialisation","duration":8,"category":"agents","icon":"cpu","desc":"Explore multimodal capabilities and performance-sensitive AI systems.","topics":["Advanced retrieval and hybrid search","Multimodal AI: image, speech, audio and documents","Fine-tuning, LoRA and efficient model adaptation","Local models, quantisation and inference optimisation","Distributed systems, event-driven agents and asynchronous workflows","Research literacy, experiment design and independent architecture"],"project":"Multimodal Document-Processing Agent"},{"id":12,"name":"Capstone, Commercialisation & Career","duration":8,"category":"agents","icon":"rocket","desc":"Turn your engineering knowledge into a demonstrable AI business product.","topics":["Finding and validating a real business problem","Product discovery, requirements and system architecture","Building an end-to-end production AI product","Multi-tenancy, billing, quotas and customer onboarding","Load testing, operational monitoring and security review","GitHub portfolio, technical interviews, documentation and demonstrations"],"project":"Deploy an SAIRE-Linked AI SaaS MVP"}],"stack":[{"title":"Python","role":"Core language","description":"Algorithms, backend development, automation, machine learning and agent logic.","tag":"01"},{"title":"TypeScript + Next.js","role":"Product interfaces","description":"Reliable, accessible learning interfaces and AI-enabled SaaS experiences.","tag":"02"},{"title":"PyTorch + scikit-learn","role":"Machine learning","description":"Data preparation, model training, neural networks and evaluation.","tag":"03"},{"title":"LangGraph + MCP","role":"Agent orchestration","description":"Stateful AI workflows, tools, approvals and external integrations.","tag":"04"},{"title":"PostgreSQL + FastAPI + Docker","role":"Infrastructure","description":"Production APIs, secure data systems and cloud deployment.","tag":"05"}],"resources":[{"name":"Official Python Tutorial","category":"Programming","url":"https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/"},{"name":"Harvard CS50","category":"Computer science","url":"https://cs50.harvard.edu/x/"},{"name":"PyTorch Tutorials","category":"Deep learning","url":"https://pytorch.org/tutorials/"},{"name":"Hugging Face Agents Course","category":"AI agents","url":"https://huggingface.co/learn/agents-course/en/unit0/in